        "body": "Hugging Face describes itself as \"The AI community building the future\" and states that it is on a journey to advance and democratize artificial intelligence through open source and open science. It is a for-profit startup founded in 2016 and headquartered in New York, NY, USA.\n\nThe company's products include Hugging Face, a model hub, and Hugging Face Transformers, a model hub and inference library with model card verification and security scanning. It also provides an MCP server named co.huggingface/hf-mcp-server, which connects to Hugging Face Hub and thousands of Gradio AI Applications.\n\nHugging Face has a New York law exposure count of 458. No litigation cases are listed.",
